# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for defects in external, unbundled libraries.
#
# Keep this file empty until a report has been confirmed to originate in such a
# library. Prefer the narrowest stable function pattern; do not suppress a race
# on RDKit-owned state merely because the access occurs in a library template.
#
# Syntax reference:
#   race:function_name_pattern
#   race:library_name_pattern
